<title>UK: Ingersoll has 77.1 pct of Newman Tonks.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll has 77.1 pct of Newman Tonks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand Co said on Friday it had extended its takeover offer for Newman Tonks Group Plc until March 20 after receiving acceptances for about 77.1 percent of the target company's shares.</p>
<p>In addition to the shares it already owns, these give the U.S.-based multinational industrial machinery manufacturer some 80.9 percent of Newman Tonks.</p>
<p>The offer has been extended until 1500 GMT on March 20.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
</text>
